{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d90110b424037f66","name":"Garrote","source":{"id":"source:reference-d90110b424037f66","title":"Garrote","revision":19917,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:51:33Z","sha256":"79669313a49af0c6f84d413cb210c4182bd919f945df35433503979a06f39151","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19917","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Garrote&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d90110b424037f66","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Typically fashioned from a strand of spun Durasteel, a Garrote is designed to crush the target's throat and prevent breathing. A Garrote requires two hands to use, and any attack made with the Garrote is treated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," attack. Bonuses granted by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," apply to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," attack as though it was a Garrote attack; for example, a character with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus (Garrote)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Garrote)"}," feat gains a +1 bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," attacks made with the Garrote.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The effects of a Garrote are felt on the target's turn. At the beginning of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," target's turn, before it can take any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"},", the target takes damage from the Garrote and moves -1 step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". The target also suffers the normal effects of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"},". The target may attempt to break the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"},", as normal.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:e0213365f7fdde76"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Small\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 50\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 1d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Slashing\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
